#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/bretonnia.adoc:291
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:242
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/witch-hunters.adoc:193
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/partials/empire-spells.adoc:42
msgid ""
"The unit can be moved just as if it had received an order in the Command "
"phase. Character stands that have joined the unit will not move with it: "
"they remain where they are."
msgstr ""
"L’unité peut être déplacée comme si elle venait de recevoir un ordre lors de "
"la phase d’Ordres. Seule l’unité visée sera affectée, pas les personnages "
"qui se trouvent avec elle (ceux-ci restent sur place)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/nippon.adoc:231
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:149
msgid ""
"If the unit charges against an enemy in the open it receives an additional "
"+1 Attack modifier in the same way as chariots and monsters."
msgstr ""
"Si l’unité charge un ennemi à découvert, elle reçoit un bonus de +1 Attaque, "
"comme les chars et les monstres."

