#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:112
msgid ""
"The following rules for Undead apply to all units except for Ghouls. Ghouls "
"are considered to be ordinary mortal troops and the following rules do not "
"apply to them."
msgstr ""
"Les règles suivantes s’appliquent à toutes leurs unités, à l’exception des "
"Goules. Ces dernières comptent comme des unités mortelles ordinaires et les "
"règles spéciales suivantes ne s’appliquent pas à elles."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:118
msgid ""
"Undead units never act on initiative. An Undead unit only moves in the "
"Command phase if given orders (aside from Fell Bats which can ‘homeback’ as "
"noted below). Including an Undead unit cannot make a supporting charge to "
"support an unit of Ghouls charging on initiative."
msgstr ""
"Les morts-vivants n’agissent jamais par initiative. Une unité de morts-"
"vivants ne peut se déplacer durant la phase d’ordre qu’après en avoir reçu "
"l’ordre (sauf les Chauves-souris Vampires qui peuvent revenir comme "
"d’ordinaire). De plus les unités mort-vivantes ne peuvent faire une charge "
"de soutien pour supporter une unité de Goules qui chargerait par initiative."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[ethereal-host,†1]]1. Ethereal Host"
msgstr "[[ethereal-host,†1]]1. Nuée Éthérée"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:136
msgid ""
"Ethereal Host Attacks always inflict a hit on a score of 4+ regardless of "
"whether the enemy is in the open, defended, or fortified. Enemy otherwise "
"count as in the open, defended, or fortified in all respects (i.e. charge "
"bonuses count or don’t count depending on status)."
msgstr ""
"Les attaques des Nuées Éthérées touchent toujours sur 4+, que l’ennemi soit "
"à découvert, en défense ou fortifié. Hormis cela, les ennemis comptent comme "
"étant dans leur statut réel (ce qui conditionne par exemple les bonus dus à "
"la charge)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:139
msgid ""
"Ethereal hosts cannot be driven back by shooting and do not roll for drive "
"backs."
msgstr ""
"Les Nuées Éthérées ne peuvent pas être repoussées par des tirs et "
"n’effectuent pas de jets de repoussement."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:142
msgid "They cause terror as described in the Warmaster rulebook."
msgstr "Elles causent la terreur."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:145
msgid "Ethereal Hosts cannot have magic items."
msgstr "Les Nuées Éthérées ne peuvent pas porter d’objet magique."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[dire-wolves,†2]]2. Dire Wolves"
msgstr "[[dire-wolves,†2]]2. Loups Funestes"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:151
msgid "Dire Wolves cannot have magic items."
msgstr "Les Loups Funestes ne peuvent pas porter d’objet magique."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:152
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[fell-bats,†3]]3. Fell Bats"
msgstr "[[fell-bats,†3]]3. Chauves-souris Vampires"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:153
msgid "Fell Bats can fly."
msgstr "Les Chauves-souris Vampires peuvent voler."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:157
msgid ""
"Although they cannot use initiative they are allowed to xref:rules:flying-"
"units.adoc#home-back[home back] as described in the Warmaster rulebook. No "
"order is required to home back."
msgstr ""
"Notez que bien qu’elles ne puissent pas agir sur initiative, elles peuvent "
"toujours xref:rules:flying-units.adoc#home-back[revenir] vers un Personnage "
"comme décrit dans le livre de règles de Warmaster. Pas besoin d’ordre pour "
"ce mouvement."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:162
msgid ""
"Fell Bats are an exception to the normal rules for basing monsters, in that "
"they are based along the long base edge in the same way as infantry, rather "
"than the short edge like other monsters."
msgstr ""
"Les Chauves-souris Vampires sont une exception aux règles de soclage des "
"monstres car elles sont soclées face à l’une des longueurs du socle, comme "
"de l’infanterie, plutôt que face à l’une des largeurs, comme les autres "
"monstres."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:163
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[vampire-lord,†4]]4. Vampire Lord"
msgstr "[[vampire-lord,†4]]4. Seigneur Vampire"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:169
msgid ""
"A Vampire Lord is a powerful sorcerers as well as the army’s general. He can "
"cast spells in the same way as a wizard and can be given a magic item "
"restricted to either a General or a Wizard. Note that the Vampire Lord is "
"still a General and his command range extends over the whole battlefield as "
"for other Generals."
msgstr ""
"Le Seigneur Vampire est un puissant sorcier en plus d’être le Général. Il "
"peut jeter des sorts de la même manière qu’un Sorcier et peut porter des "
"objets magiques limités aux Généraux et aux Sorciers. Notez qu’en tant que "
"Général sa portée de commandement s’étend sur tout le champs de bataille."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[winged-nightmare,†5]]5. Winged Nightmare"
msgstr "[[winged-nightmare,†5]]5. Cauchemar Ailé"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:172
msgid "Any character can ride a Winged Nightmare."
msgstr "N’importe quel personnage peut être monté sur un Cauchemar Ailé."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:175
msgid ""
"A winged Nightmare can fly increasing its rider’s move to 100cm and adding "
"+2 to its rider’s attacks."
msgstr ""
"Un Cauchemar Ailé peut voler améliorant le mouvement de son cavalier à 100cm "
"et ajoute +2 attaques à son profil."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:178
msgid ""
"A unit joined by a character riding a Nightmare causes terror in its enemies."
msgstr ""
"Une unité rejointe par un personnage sur Cauchemar Ailé provoque la terreur."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:179
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[black-coach,†6]]6. Black Coach"
msgstr "[[black-coach,†6]]6. Carrosse Noir"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:181
msgid ""
"A Vampire Lord or Vampire can be mounted within a Black Coach adding +1 to "
"its occupant’s attacks."
msgstr ""
"Un Seigneur Vampire ou un Vampire peut embarquer dans un Carrosse Noir, qui "
"confère +1 Attaque à son passager."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:185
msgid ""
"A unit joined by a character riding in the Black Coach causes terror in its "
"enemies."
msgstr ""
"Une unité rejointe par un personnage dans un Carrosse Noir provoque la "
"terreur."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:190
#, no-wrap
msgid "Vampire Counts spells"
msgstr "Sorts des Comtes Vampires"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:226
#, no-wrap
msgid "Vanhel’s Danse Macabre"
msgstr "Danse Macabre de Vanhel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:229
msgid "[.cost]#5+ to cast# [.points]#Range 40cm#"
msgstr "[.cost]#5+ pour lancer# [.points]#Portée 40cm#"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:232
msgid ""
"_The bodies of the dead move under the powerful influence of necromantic "
"magic renewing their vigour once more._"
msgstr ""
"_Sous l’influence de la nécromancie, les corps des trépassés sont animés "
"d’une vigueur infernale._"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:238
msgid ""
"This spell can be cast on any friendly unit apart from Ghouls.  The spell "
"can be cast on a unit within range regardless of whether the Wizard can see "
"it or not. The spell affects only a single unit, never a brigade and there "
"is no supporting charge possible."
msgstr ""
"Ce sort peut être lancé sur n’importe quelle unité amie à portée, à "
"l’exception des Goules, que le sorcier puisse la voir ou non. Le sort "
"n’affecte qu’une seule unité, jamais une brigade, et aucune charge de "
"soutien n’est possible."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:257
msgid ""
"The Necromancer must be able to see his target to cast this spell and it "
"cannot be directed against a unit in combat. The Deathbolt is treated like "
"three ordinary shooting attacks except that armour has no effect (all "
"targets count as having no armour). A unit can be driven back by Deathbolt "
"as with ordinary shooting."
msgstr ""
"Le Sorcier peut lancer ce sort sur une unité ennemie en vue qui n’est pas "
"engagée en combat. L’unité victime de l’Éclair de Mort subit trois attaques "
"résolues comme des attaques de tir ordinaires mais son Armure est ignorée "
"(quelle que soit la cible de ce sort, elle compte comme n’ayant aucune "
"armure). Une unité peut être repoussée par un Éclair de Mort de la même "
"manière que par des tirs ordinaires."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:259
#, no-wrap
msgid "Curse of Years"
msgstr "Vieillissement"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:262
msgid "[.cost]#6+ to cast# [.points]#Range N/A#"
msgstr "[.cost]#6+ pour lancer# [.points]#Portée N/A#"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:265
msgid ""
"_The Wizard’s enemies crumble to dust as he smites them with the corrupting "
"Curse of Years._"
msgstr ""
"_Les ennemis du Sorcier tombent en poussière tandis qu’il déchaîne sur eux "
"la malédiction des siècles._"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:269
msgid ""
"The Wizard can cast this spell if he has joined a unit in combat.  The spell "
"can be cast on any single enemy unit that is touching the unit the Wizard "
"has joined."
msgstr ""
"Ce sort ne peut être lancé que si le Sorcier a rejoint une unité amie "
"engagée au combat, et affecte une seule unité ennemie au contact de celle-ci."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:274
msgid ""
"The target unit takes six attacks worked out in the usual way.  Any hits "
"scored are carried over into the first round of combat and count as having "
"been struck in the first round for purposes of working out combat results."
msgstr ""
"La cible subit six attaques résolues de la manière habituelle. Toute touche "
"infligée est reportée dans le premier round de combat et compte comme ayant "
"été infligée au combat pour ce qui est de sa résolution."
